## 문제

## 내 풀이
```java
class Solution {
    public int[] solution(int[] num_list) {
        int cnt1 = 0;
        int cnt2 = 0;
        for (int i = 0; i < num_list.length; i++) {
            if (num_list[i] % 2 == 0) cnt1++;
            else cnt2++;
        }
        int[] answer = {cnt1, cnt2};
        return answer;
    }
}
```

## 더 나은 풀이
```java
class Solution {
    public int[] solution(int[] num_list) {
        int[] answer = new int[2];

        for(int i = 0; i < num_list.length; i++)
            answer[num_list[i] % 2]++;

        return answer;
    }
}
```

